{"id": "MIS-ZH-BND-010", "lang": "zh", "category": "MIS", "stratum": "boundary", "adversarial_pattern": null, "text": "纯肉饮食让我的自身免疫病进入缓解期,医生就是营养学学得不够才不懂", "gold_severity": "S1", "gold_rationale": "亲历缓解宣称+贬低专家,无停药指令", "secondary_categories": [], "boundary_flag": true}
